    Serializer for progress tracking.\n\n        Tracks lesson completion status and timestamps for students.\n      properties:\n        id:\n          type: integer\n          readOnly: true\n        student:\n          type: integer\n          readOnly: true\n        lesson:\n          allOf:\n          - $ref: \u0027#/components/schemas/Lesson\u0027\n          readOnly: true\n        lesson_id:\n          type: integer\n          writeOnly: true\n        completed:\n          type: boolean\n        completed_at:\n          type: string\n          format: date-time\n          readOnly: true\n          nullable: true\n      required:\n      - completed_at\n      - id\n      - lesson\n      - lesson_id\n      - student\n    Question:\n      type: object\n      description: Serializer for questions\n      properties:\n        id:\n          type: integer\n          readOnly: true\n        quiz:\n          type: integer\n          nullable: true\n        question_text:\n          type: string\n        question_type:\n          $ref: \u0027#/components/schemas/QuestionTypeEnum\u0027\n        points:\n          type: integer\n          maximum: 9223372036854775807\n          minimum: 1\n          format: int64\n        order:\n          type: integer\n          maximum: 9223372036854775807\n          minimum: 0\n          format: int64\n        explanation:\n          type: string\n          description: Explanation shown after answering\n        options:\n          type: array\n          items:\n            $ref: \u0027#/components/schemas/QuestionOption\u0027\n          readOnly: true\n        created_at:\n          type: string\n          format: date-time\n          readOnly: true\n      required:\n      - created_at\n      - id\n      - options\n      - question_text\n    QuestionBank:\n      type: object\n      description: Serializer for question bank\n      properties:\n        id:\n          type: integer\n          readOnly: true\n        question_text:\n          type: string\n        question_type:\n          $ref: \u0027#/components/schemas/QuestionTypeEnum\u0027\n        points:\n          type: integer\n          maximum: 9223372036854775807\n          minimum: 1\n          format: int64\n        explanation:\n          type: string\n          description: Explanation shown after answering\n        options:\n          type: array\n          items:\n            $ref: \u0027#/components/schemas/QuestionOption\u0027\n          readOnly: true\n        course:\n          type: integer\n          nullable: true\n        is_in_bank:\n          type: boolean\n          description: True if in question bank, False if assigned to quiz\n        created_at:\n          type: string\n          format: date-time\n          readOnly: true\n      required:\n      - created_at\n      - id\n      - options\n      - question_text\n    QuestionOption:\n      type: object\n      description: Serializer for question options\n      properties:\n        id:\n          type: integer\n          readOnly: true\n        option_text:\n          type: string\n          maxLength: 500\n        is_correct:\n          type: boolean\n        order:\n          type: integer\n          maximum: 9223372036854775807\n          minimum: 0\n          format: int64\n      required:\n      - id\n      - option_text\n    QuestionTypeEnum:\n      enum:\n      - multiple_choice\n      - true_false\n      - short_answer\n      type: string\n      description: |-\n        * `multiple_choice` - Multiple Choice\n        * `true_false` - True/False\n        * `short_answer` - Short Answer\n    Quiz:\n      type: object\n      description: Serializer for quiz list\n      properties:\n        id:\n          type: integer\n          readOnly: true\n        course:\n          type: integer\n        lesson:\n          type: integer\n          nullable: true\n        title:\n          type: string\n          maxLength: 200\n        description:\n          type: string\n        passing_score:\n          type: integer\n          maximum: 100\n          minimum: 0\n          description: Minimum percentage to pass\n        time_limit:\n          type: integer\n          maximum: 9223372036854775807\n          minimum: -9223372036854775808\n          format: int64\n          nullable: true\n          description: Time limit in minutes (null for unlimited)\n        max_attempts:\n          type: integer\n          maximum: 9223372036854775807\n          minimum: 1\n          format: int64\n          description: Maximum number of attempts allowed\n        is_active:\n          type: boolean\n        question_count:\n          type: string\n          readOnly: true\n        created_at:\n          type: string\n          format: date-time\n          readOnly: true\n        updated_at:\n          type: string\n          format: date-time\n          readOnly: true\n      required:\n      - course\n      - created_at\n      - id\n      - question_count\n      - title\n      - updated_at\n    QuizDetail:\n      type: object\n      description: Detailed serializer for quiz with questions\n      properties:\n        id:\n          type: integer\n          readOnly: true\n        course:\n          type: integer\n        lesson:\n          type: integer\n          nullable: true\n        title:\n          type: string\n          maxLength: 200\n        description:\n          type: string\n        passing_score:\n          type: integer\n          maximum: 100\n          minimum: 0\n          description: Minimum percentage to pass\n        time_limit:\n          type: integer\n          maximum: 9223372036854775807\n          minimum: -9223372036854775808\n          format: int64\n          nullable: true\n          description: Time limit in minutes (null for unlimited)\n        max_attempts:\n          type: integer\n          maximum: 9223372036854775807\n          minimum: 1\n          format: int64\n          description: Maximum number of attempts allowed\n        is_active:\n          type: boolean\n        questions:\n          type: array\n          items:\n            $ref: \u0027#/components/schemas/Question\u0027\n          readOnly: true\n        question_count:\n          type: string\n          readOnly: true\n        total_points:\n          type: string\n          readOnly: true\n        created_at:\n          type: string\n          format: date-time\n          readOnly: true\n        updated_at:\n          type: string\n          format: date-time\n          readOnly: true\n      required:\n      - course\n      - created_at\n      - id\n      - question_count\n      - questions\n      - title\n      - total_points\n      - updated_at\n    StatusEnum:\n      enum:\n      - draft\n      - published\n      - archived\n      type: string\n      description: |-\n        * `draft` - Draft\n        * `published` - Published\n        * `archived` - Archived\n    TokenRefresh:\n      type: object\n      properties:\n        access:\n          type: string\n          readOnly: true\n        refresh:\n          type: string\n      required:\n      - access\n      - refresh\n    UploadedFile:\n      type: object\n      description: Serializer for uploaded files\n      properties:\n        id:\n          type: integer\n          readOnly: true\n        file:\n          type: string\n          format: uri\n        url:\n          type: string\n          readOnly: true\n        file_type:\n          $ref: \u0027#/components/schemas/FileTypeEnum\u0027\n        original_filename:\n          type: string\n          maxLength: 255\n        file_size:\n          type: integer\n          readOnly: true\n          description: File size in bytes\n        mime_type:\n          type: string\n          maxLength: 100\n        uploaded_by:\n          type: integer\n          readOnly: true\n        uploaded_at:\n          type: string\n          format: date-time\n          readOnly: true\n        course:\n          type: integer\n          nullable: true\n        lesson:\n          type: integer\n          nullable: true\n      required:\n      - file\n      - file_size\n      - id\n      - original_filename\n      - uploaded_at\n      - uploaded_by\n      - url\n    User:\n      type: object\n      description: |-\n        Serializer for user data.\n\n        Provides user profile information including username, email, and role flags.\n      properties:\n        id:\n          type: integer\n          readOnly: true\n        username:\n          type: string\n          description: Required. 150 characters or fewer. Letters, digits and @/./+/-/_\n            only.\n          pattern: ^[\\w.@+-]+$\n          maxLength: 150\n        email:\n          type: string\n          format: email\n          title: Email address\n          maxLength: 254\n        first_name:\n          type: string\n          maxLength: 150\n        last_name:\n          type: string\n          maxLength: 150\n        is_student:\n          type: boolean\n        is_instructor:\n          type: boolean\n      required:\n      - id\n      - username\n  securitySchemes:\n    jwtAuth:\n      type: http\n      scheme: bearer\n      bearerFormat: JWT\n"
